OL,3,AArboretum's name change faces veterans'
OL,4,Abacklash
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Memorial Arboretum's name
OL,7,Fchange this month has been called
OL,8,F"diminishing" and "unnecessary" by some
OL,9,Fvisitors, including veterans.
OL,11,FPlans for the new name, Royal British
OL,12,FLegion National Remembrance Gardens,
OL,13,Fwere announced in April. The armed
OL,14,Fforces charity said it was to reflect
OL,15,Fthe arboretum's full integration with
OL,16,FRBL and broaden public engagement.
OL,18,FAbout 25,000 people signed a petition
OL,19,Fagainst the move, including Royal Air
OL,20,FForce veteran Paul Cornhill, who visits
OL,21,Fthe site in Alrewas, Staffordshire, to
OL,22,Fremember his stillborn daughter.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
