OL,3,AArboretum's name change faces veterans'
OL,4,Abacklash
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I've decided it's a step too far to
OL,7,Fchange the name to what they want,"
OL,8,Fsaid Cornhill, from Tamworth, vowing
OL,9,Fnot to attend future Remembrance
OL,10,Fservices.
